 "intro_zh": "据一个古老的传说，大津巴布韦遗址是希巴皇后的首府，同时还是11世纪到15世纪期间绍纳城班图文明唯一的见证。这座城市面积将近80公顷，曾经是一个重要的贸易中心，自中世纪以来闻名于世。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "The ruins of Great Zimbabwe – the capital of the Queen of Sheba, according to an age-old legend – are a unique testimony to the Bantu civilization of the Shona between the 11th and 15th centuries. The city, which covers an area of nearly 80 ha, was an important trading centre and was renowned from the Middle Ages onwards.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_local": "",
 "intro_local_source": null,
